    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="56.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 56.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif se nægl bið ófaslegen, ðam sculon V scill to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the nail is struck off, for that 5 shillings shall be the compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If the nail is struck off, 5 shillings must be paid as compensation for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif se nægl biþ ofaslægen, ðam sculon V scll' to bote.</ab>
      </div>
